<title>USA: Sterling Bancshares sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Sterling Bancshares sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Bancshares Inc said on Tuesday it declared a three-for-two stock split payable February 24, 1997 to shareholders of record on February 10.</p>
<p>As of the end of the fourth quarter, the company had about eight million shares of common stock.</p>
</text>
